<title>UK: Wuerttembergische Hypo sets 100 mln mark 4-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Wuerttembergische Hypo sets 100 mln mark 4-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Sal. Oppenheim jr &amp; Cie.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WUERRTEMBERGISCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON     *4.0 PCT  MATURITY  **17.JAN.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  UNDISC    PAY DATE  S-17.SEP.96</p>
<p>FULL FEES  UNDISC</p>
<p> NOTES	*FOR FIRST YEAR THEN STEPS UP TO 5.0 PCT</p>
<p>	     **CALLABLE 17.JAN.97 ONLY AT PAR</p>
<p>	     S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> LISTING    STUTT     DENOMS (K) 10	  PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> NOTES	OFFENLICHE PFANDBRIEFE SERIE 785</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
